# Dodge: rocks fall from the sky. Every rock that falls past you is a point.
# Shows: gravity on some things only, random spawning, "leaves the screen", and a timer.

game
  size 240 by 320
  pixel art
  background midnight blue
  gravity 0.08

score starts at 0
best starts at 0

thing player
  looks like aquamarine box 14 by 10
  starts at 113, 290

thing rock
  looks like light slate gray box 12 by 12
  falls

when left key is held and player x is above 0
  move player left 3
when right key is held and player x is below 226
  move player right 3

when every 0.6 seconds
  make a rock at random 0 to 228, -14

# After 20 seconds, a surprise wave.
when after 20 seconds
  make a rock at random 0 to 228, -14
  make a rock at random 0 to 228, -40

when rock leaves the screen
  remove the rock
  add 1 to score

when rock touches player
  show text "Bonk! Score {score}" in salmon
  stop game

always
  show text "{score}" at 8, 16 in white
